---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import portrait from "../assets/aoun-portrait.png";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Aoun Md."
  description="Learn about Aoun Md.'s background, engineering experience, education, and selected technical credentials."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / BACKGROUND & EXPERIENCE</p>

      <h1 class="page-title">
        A little more
        <span class="serif-accent">about me.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="page-description">
        I am a Cloud and DevOps engineer based in India with an MCA background.
        Here is a look at my background, the internship teams I have worked with,
        the systems I have built independently, and what I am looking for next.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-border section">
    <div class="container info-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="about-portrait">
          <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Aoun Md."
            format="webp"
            widths={[360, 540, 720, 900]}
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 400px"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">MY BACKGROUND</p>

        <h2
          style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.06em;"
        >
          From application code to the infrastructure
          <span class="serif-accent">behind it.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-muted">
          During my software development internship, I worked on AssembleMonitor using React, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL.
          That experience helped me understand application development,
          authentication, database operations, and API integration.
        </p>

        <p class="text-muted">
          I later implemented its AWS infrastructure and DevOps workflows
          independently. At Elevate Labs, I worked with GitHub Actions,
          Jenkins, Docker, AWS EC2, Terraform, and deployment verification
          using the RenewGrid application.
        </p>

        <p class="text-muted">
          My work now covers both application development and the
          infrastructure used to deliver it. I'm particularly interested
          in automation, secure deployment workflows, and understanding
          how systems behave when something goes wrong.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="section section-border"
    id="experience"
    aria-labelledby="experience-heading"
  >
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</p>

        <h2 id="experience-heading">
          Internship
          <span class="serif-accent">experience.</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Practical work across DevOps automation,
          application development, and cloud support.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-list">
        <div class="detail-item">
          <strong>DevOps Intern · Elevate Labs</strong>
          <span>October 2026</span>

          <p>
            Built and verified delivery workflows for RenewGrid using
            GitHub Actions and Jenkins. The work included application
            validation, container publication to GHCR and Docker Hub,
            security scanning, SBOM generation, and Docker Compose
            deployment verification on GitHub-hosted runners and AWS EC2.
          </p>
          <p>
            Managed a separate local Compose environment using Terraform's
            Docker provider, including planning, applying, state
            reconciliation, and teardown. Also worked with pull requests,
            automated checks, and versioned releases.
          </p>
          <a class="experience-project-link" href="/work/renewgrid/">
            Explore RenewGrid engineering work
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-item">
          <strong>Software Developer Intern · Noorisys Technologies</strong>
          <span>February to May 2026</span>

          <p>
            Worked on AssembleMonitor, a construction management
            application built with React, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL.
            Contributed to application workflows, APIs, database
            operations, JWT authentication, and role-based access.
          </p>
          <p>
            After the internship, independently implemented its
            AWS infrastructure, Kubernetes delivery workflows,
            security controls, and observability configuration.
          </p>
          <a class="experience-project-link" href="/work/assemblemonitor/">
            Explore AssembleMonitor
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-item">
          <strong>Cloud Support Intern · CanveX</strong>
          <span>January to March 2025 · Remote</span>

          <p>
            Supported website, file, and database migrations through
            hosting dashboards. Worked with backups, content
            verification after transfers, storage and synchronization
            tasks, and troubleshooting website issues with a remote
            support team.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-border">
    <div class="container info-grid">
      <div class="info-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">EDUCATION</p>

        <h2>Academic background</h2>

        <div class="detail-list">
          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>Master of Computer Applications (MCA)</strong>
            <span>2024 to 2026 · Savitribai Phule Pune University</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>B.Sc. Computer Science</strong>
            <span>2021 to 2024 · Savitribai Phule Pune University</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED CREDENTIALS</p>

        <h2>Courses and certifications</h2>

        <div class="detail-list">
          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>
              Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified Foundations Associate
            </strong>
            <span>
              Oracle | Issued September 25, 2025
            </span>
            <span>
              Valid through September 25, 2027
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>
              Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified AI Foundations Associate
            </strong>
            <span>
              Oracle | Issued October 2, 2025
            </span>
            <span>
              Valid through October 2, 2027
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>Ethical Hacking</strong>
            <span>
              NPTEL | 12-week course | July to October 2025
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-item">
            <strong>Web Technology</strong>
            <span>
              SWAYAM | Completed December 2025
            </span>
            <span>
              Certificate issued January 2026
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-border">
    <div class="container info-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT I'M LOOKING FOR</p>

        <h2 class="page-title">
          Roles I'm
          <span class="serif-accent">seeking.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="page-description">
          I am looking for junior or associate roles across Cloud Engineering,
          DevOps, and infrastructure automation.
        </p>

        <p class="text-muted">
          I am available for full-time positions in India, as well as remote
          roles with engineering teams worldwide.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a
            class="button button-primary"
            href="mailto:aounmd74@gmail.com"
          >
            Get in touch
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="button button-secondary"
            href="/resume/Aoun_MD_Resume.pdf"
            download="Aoun_MD_Resume.pdf"
          >
            Download resume
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
